02 Bài giải:

a)
683 x 35 = 23905
1954 x 425 = 830450
2438 x 306 = 746028
b) \(\frac{7}{9}\) x\(\frac{3}{35}\)=\(\frac{7 \times 3}{9 \times 35}\) =\(\frac{7 \times 3}{3 \times 3 \times 5 \times 7}\) = \(\frac{1}{3 \times 5}\)=\(\frac{1}{15}\)
\(\frac{9}{22}\)x 55 =\(\frac{9 \times 55}{22}\)=\(\frac{9 \times 5 \times 11}{2 \times 11}\)=\(\frac{9 \times 5}{2}\)=\(\frac{45}{2}\)
\(\frac{11}{17}\): \(\frac{33}{34}\)=\(\frac{11}{17}\)x\(\frac{34}{33}\)=\(\frac{11 \times 34}{17 \times 33}\)= \(\frac{11 \times 2 \times 17}{17 \times 3 \times 11}\)=\(\frac{2}{3}\)
d)
16 hours 15 minutes : 5 = 3 hours 15 minutes
16 giờ 15 phút : 5 = 3 giờ 15 phút
14 minutes 36 seconds : 12 = 1 minute 13 seconds
14 phút 36 giây : 12 = 1 phút 13 giây

